{
  "id": "b02",
  "title": "The Rainy Day Show",
  "titleZh": "雨天的展示课",
  "topic": "校园",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "It is a rainy Monday, and our class meets upstairs.",
        "zh": "这是一个下雨的周一，我们班在楼上上课。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Madame writes a warm greeting on the old board for us.",
        "zh": "夫人为我们在这块旧黑板上写下一句温暖的问候。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our composition today is about grammar and old family stories.",
        "zh": "我们今天的作文写的是语法和古老的家庭故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A common hobby can make a dull day feel bright.",
        "zh": "一个普通的爱好能让沉闷的一天变得明亮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Just one girl is absent from our class today.",
        "zh": "今天班里只有一位女生缺席。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My classmate's place stays cold and empty all morning.",
        "zh": "我同学的座位整个上午都冷冷清清、空着。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An advertisement for our little show fills the blackboard now.",
        "zh": "一张宣传我们小演出的广告现在占满了黑板。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We post a small notice beside the long front row.",
        "zh": "我们把一张小通知贴在前排旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A warm lamp sits on the old brown wooden drawer.",
        "zh": "一盏温暖的灯放在那张旧的棕色木抽屉上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "At noon, the menu lists warm bread and cold coke.",
        "zh": "正午时，菜单上列着热面包和冰可乐。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A red tomato and cold coke wait on the table.",
        "zh": "一个红番茄和冰可乐在桌上等着我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our picnic moves into the warm, noisy school gym today.",
        "zh": "我们的野餐今天移到了温暖又热闹的学校体育馆里。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A silly song about cabbage makes the whole class laugh.",
        "zh": "一首关于卷心菜的傻歌让全班都笑了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Kind hands pass a spoon and a small paper plate.",
        "zh": "一双友善的手递来一把勺子和一个小纸盘。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her recorder music sounds fantastic in the big old hall.",
        "zh": "她的录音机音乐在又大又旧的礼堂里听起来棒极了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He shows an airplane he helped invent at home today.",
        "zh": "他今天展示了一架他在家帮忙做出来的飞机。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her little ant farm is a small, living treasure.",
        "zh": "她的小蚂蚁农场是一件小小的、活着的宝物。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A toy snake and a duck sit on the desk.",
        "zh": "一条玩具蛇和一只鸭子放在书桌上。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "After geography, we watch a fire in a dry forest.",
        "zh": "地理课后，我们观看了一场干燥森林里的火灾。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A ruler and an eraser roll off the desk.",
        "zh": "一把尺子和一块橡皮从书桌上滚了下来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A purple tiger dances across her open drawing book.",
        "zh": "一只紫色的老虎跃过她摊开的画本。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A fisherman tells us about a rose and a boat.",
        "zh": "一位渔夫给我们讲了一朵玫瑰和一条船的故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Granny will mend my old winter coat before supper.",
        "zh": "奶奶会在晚饭前补好我的旧冬衣。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We wave goodbye as one red balloon flies far away.",
        "zh": "我们挥手告别，一只红气球飞得远远的。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "You yourselves may tell a humorous story tonight.",
        "zh": "你们自己今晚也可以讲一个幽默的故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A dvd and a kilo of sweet grapes go home.",
        "zh": "一张光盘和一公斤甜葡萄被带回了家。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I pack my toothbrush and toothpaste in the bag.",
        "zh": "我把牙刷和牙膏装进包里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We can wash our hands with soap and warm water.",
        "zh": "我们可以用肥皂和温水洗手。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This quiet corner is ours, so do not disturb it.",
        "zh": "这个安静的角落是我们的，所以请不要打扰它。"
      }
    ]
  ],
